<style>
.social-proof-section {
  padding: 100px 24px;
  background: #0a0a0a;
  border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
}
.social-proof-header {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto 48px;
}
.social-proof-header h2 {
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px);
  font-weight: 900;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px;
}
.social-proof-header p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  font-size: 15px;
}
.reviews-grid {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: #1a1a1a;
}
.review-card {
  background: #000;
  padding: 32px;
  transition: all 0.3s;
}
.review-card:hover {
  background: #0a0a0a;
}
.review-stars {
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.review-text {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.review-author {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}
.review-avatar {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #1a1a1a;
  color: #fff;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
}
.review-name {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
}
.review-verified {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}
.ugc-banner {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 48px auto 0;
  background: #111;
  padding: 40px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 32px;
  color: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
}
.ugc-banner h3 {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}
.ugc-banner p {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  font-size: 14px;
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .reviews-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .ugc-banner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; padding: 28px; }
  .social-proof-section { padding: 60px 20px; }
}
</style>

<section class="social-proof-section">
  <div class="social-proof-header">
    <h2>Real Women. Real Results.</h2>
    <p>Join 50,000 who already transformed their posture.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reviews-grid">
    <div class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="review-text">"I've tried 4 different posture bras and this is the ONLY one that actually works. My husband noticed my posture improvement in just one week."</p>
      <div class="review-author">
        <div class="review-avatar">SM</div>
        <div>
          <div class="review-name">Sarah M.</div>
          <div class="review-verified">Verified Buyer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="review-text">"As a nurse working 12-hour shifts, my back pain was unbearable. PostureBlend eliminated my upper back pain completely. I own 3 now."</p>
      <div class="review-author">
        <div class="review-avatar">JL</div>
        <div>
          <div class="review-name">Jennifer L.</div>
          <div class="review-verified">Verified Buyer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="review-text">"I was skeptical but the 30-day guarantee convinced me. Best $30 I've spent. My chiropractor asked what I've been doing differently."</p>
      <div class="review-author">
        <div class="review-avatar">AR</div>
        <div>
          <div class="review-name">Amanda R.</div>
          <div class="review-verified">Verified Buyer</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ugc-banner">
    <div>
      <h3>Share Your Transformation</h3>
      <p>Tag @postureblend.bra on TikTok or Instagram. Get featured + earn $10 store credit.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 28px;">✦✦✦</div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Social Proof",
  "presets": [{"name": "Social Proof"}]
}
{% endschema %}